            "printedPage": 75
          }
        ],
        "text": "(Punyakodi's house—night. Punyakodi knocks at the door.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s067-u002",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குரல்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s067-d001",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 83,
            "printedPage": 75
          }
        ],
        "text": "Radha! Radha!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s067-u003",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "sourceRecordId": null,
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 83,
            "printedPage": 75
          }
        ],
        "text": "(Paranthaman leaves by another side. Punyakodi comes in. Radha tries to tell him that Paranthaman had come.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s067-u004",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s067-d002",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 83,
            "printedPage": 75
          }
        ],
        "text": "Radha, serve the food quickly!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s067-u005",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "ராதா",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s067-d003",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 83,
            "printedPage": 75
          }
        ],
        "text": "..........",
        "notes": [
          "The source prints only dots for Radha's labelled response; no vocalization is invented."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s067-u006",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s067-d004",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 83,
            "printedPage": 75
          }
        ],
        "text": "What... today I have to eat on time and go to bed...",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s067-u007",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "sourceRecordId": null,
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 83,
            "printedPage": 75
          }
        ],
        "text": "(She points to the gramophone, indicating that it had been played.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s067-u008",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s067-d005",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 83,
            "printedPage": 75
          }
        ],
        "text": "Yes! Is this the time to listen to music! Serve the food!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s067-u009",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "sourceRecordId": null,
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 83,
            "printedPage": 75
          }
        ],
        "text": "(She points to the window through which Paranthaman left.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s067-u010",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s067-d006",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 83,
            "printedPage": 75
          }
        ],
        "text": "If the window is open, just close it...",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s067-u011",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "sourceRecordId": null,
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 83,
            "printedPage": 75
          }
        ],
        "text": "(She tries to say something more.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s067-u012",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s067-d007",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 84,
            "printedPage": 76
          }
        ],
        "text": "Forget all that! Are you going to serve the food or not!",
        "notes": []
      }
    ]
  }
}
